1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,450
Sony to Kill Physical PlayStation Discs by 2028.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:12,412
Sony announced on July 1, 2026 that from January 2028 all new PlayStation games will be digital-only.

3
00:00:12,412 --> 00:00:14,812
The reaction was furious.

4
00:00:14,812 --> 00:00:20,012
An online petition gathered over 170,000 signatures within a week.

5
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:23,637
Players called it the darkest day in PlayStation history.

6
00:00:23,637 --> 00:00:31,362
Digital downloads mean no sharing games, no used game stores, no guaranteed access after servers shut down.

7
00:00:31,362 --> 00:00:36,525
Sonys own terms remind players they dont own digital games - they license them.

8
00:00:36,525 --> 00:00:40,637
Critics point to Sonys history of removing purchased content.

9
00:00:40,637 --> 00:00:47,712
Meanwhile GTA 6 already ships with download code only, proving the industry is heading this way fast.

